Exception Handling :
===================
 An exception is an abnornmal condition 
 that disturbs/disrupts the normal
 flow of Execution.
 
 A flow is said to be normal when all 
 the stataments are scucessfully executed in the program.
 This is also known as Gracefull termination of program.
 
 
 If the program Stops without executing all
 the statements then we say that it is an 
 abnormal termination of program.
 
 

 
 Exception handling using try-catch :
 
 syntax:
 ======
 try{
 	//risky code
 	}catch(Exception e){ 
            //handling code
            }
 
   
 